  message: "2026-10-25 (owner-requested note, from a review of how WI-ziruv and WI-kosup bear on the open concept-audit rows): Neither WI-ziruv nor WI-kosup catches this. Four consumers disagree on one fact, and the contract they should share (when anchored code runs) was never written, so WI-ziruv has no rule to falsify. The fix shape here writes that contract. Does not wait for either audit."  # 55e3
